    "weblio.jp/content/Milk+tea: in Japan milk tea usually means black tea with milk added",
    "latte = Italian 'milk' (caffè latte = coffee with milk) — general knowledge",
    "No official definition exists → hedged with 「お店によっては」 and the hook avoids claiming a rule"
